    "rich_text_VbD9eK": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "custom_css": [
        ".rte {text-align: left;}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "text_width": "wide",
        "title": "",
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.com/\" target=\"_blank\">HEARNS HOBBIES</a> have a vast variety of model kits to cover every interest. Whether your interest is <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/aircraft\">aircraft</a>,<a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/armour\">military vehicles</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/model-kit-cars\">cars</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/plastic-model-buildings\">buildings</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/movie-tv\">movie subjects</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/ships\">ships </a>or <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/gundams\">Gundam </a>we have it all. We also have a range of wooden kits which extends to ships and planes. Our team has extensive knowledge in model making including scratch building & painting so they can offer the advice on what is the best kit for you regardless if you are a beginner or a more advanced modeller.<br/><br/>We are leading supplier for hobbies in Melbourne and in Australia since 1947; since then we have been committed to bring into Australia the models and the tools that you need to create the diorama of your dreams!<br/><br/>Key brands and leading manufacturer of plastic model kits are: <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/arifix\">Airfix</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/tamiya\">Tamiya</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/trumpeter\">Trumpeter</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/italeri\">Italeri</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/copper-state-models\">Copper State model</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/bandai\">Bandai </a>and many more.</p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": ""
      }
    },
